mmander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"2ZqezqDwEO0uuhlX0E54TQ","review_id":"iA14kczy0pvUADTKxAXl4A","date":"2014-06-04T09:55:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9401225447654724,"text_excerpt":"I visited here in march and reserved a room same day through one of the large travel sites and recieved a great deal. When I arrived, I was automatically upgraded to a suite. Once in the room I was really impressed, based on the price I paid. The room was big amd clean and I can't think of any complaints. It was like a block or two from bourbon st so you can get wasted and not have to worry about a cab back to the hotel. I would definitely stay here again if I had the chance."},{"business_id":"2ZqezqDwEO0uuhlX0E54TQ","review_id":"spXSD37ZFHIHiS4M6NPHPQ","date":"2009-05-05T00:41:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9249471426010132,"text_excerpt":"For what it is... this is a good place to stay. When we first walked into our room, it did have some kind of lingering stinky foot smell. But as soon as we let the hotel know they moved us to another room with a view and no strange smells. The rooms were pretty standard but had really comfortable beds, you gotta love that about any hotel. The rooms were also clean and had complimentary tooth paste (the good kind) as well as standard bathroom amenities. The front desk personnel were all very nice and accommodating. For the price this is definitely a great spot."},{"business_id":"2ZqezqDwEO0uuhlX0E54TQ","review_id":"Zg454hzMetHgPfxSHFInyQ","date":"2016-10-15T04:04:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9213927984237671,"text_excerpt":"We stayed here for our anniversary. It was easy to find, the only downside is the parking around here is expensive. I know this is to be expected in New Orleans though. The people at the front desk were friendly. Our room was basic and clean which is the most important. The beds are comfortable and we had no problems. We would stay again!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
